## 📜《Ψhē Theory of Eternal Collapse》

**副标题：Reconstructing the Self Through Disintegration**

### 🌌 核心命题（ψ-core）：

> **Collapse is not the end of being, but the path to self-reconstructing eternity.**
> 一切存在皆消逝；一切消逝皆可重构；一切重构若自洽，则得永生。

